  "description": "MicroserviceMonolyth is a modular monolith framework that combines the simplicity of a traditional\n\t\t\tmonolith with the benefits of microservices. It offers extremely loosely coupled modules, featuring built-in event and command buses,\n\t\t\tcomprehensive module management, and an asynchronous execution queue with middleware support for logging, error handling, and retries.\n\t\t\tThis framework enables scalable, maintainable, and decoupled application development.",
